author: "harness:claude-code"
close_reason: "Handler suite added and the gate raised to 98/91/97 from 88/87/90; measured 98.35 lines 91.86 branches 97.17 functions with release:check green end to end. No threshold weakened, no coverage exclusion added, and the one coverage-motivated production change was reverted."
body: ""
